  {
   "id": "results",
   "heading": "Results",
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In Method B, the camera detected the color flip at 76.0 s when lab_a changed +29.8 from a baseline of 4.6, and the light sensor confirmed the flip +0.50 s later.",
     "evidence_ids": [
      "evt:024d868d-afd0-4a8f-a6ca-e0384403b6da",
      "frm:b2ebaf8f-be2e-4eb9-9bdf-a4e95af1f57c",
      "evt:843d54c2-df2b-4460-8f47-3bcb2626b855"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In Method A, the camera detected the color flip at 112.0 s when lab_a changed +29.7 from a baseline of 4.0, and the light sensor confirmed the flip +0.00 s later.",
     "evidence_ids": [
      "evt:e8fbac95-fdbd-4ce4-893a-2f208da14e3e",
      "frm:c70a62a3-2a72-42c2-9cbe-963e2c9966f1",
      "evt:ac680365-1c4e-4236-befd-3b8a127112d7"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The base added at the color flip was 2.5 mL in Method B and 4.0 mL in Method A, a difference of -1.5 mL that is outside the normal variation of ±1 mL.",
     "evidence_ids": [
      "evt:024d868d-afd0-4a8f-a6ca-e0384403b6da",
      "frm:b2ebaf8f-be2e-4eb9-9bdf-a4e95af1f57c",
      "evt:de2f27b3-b44b-4fec-9859-583ce53d236c",
